stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> REQUESTED: S1 artefact validated and approved, or portal task raised
    REQUESTED --> READY: S2 pre-checks pass
    READY --> CHECKED_OUT: S3 operator starts, credential bound to the session
    CHECKED_OUT --> AUTHENTICATING: S4 sign-in begun, the human solves any CAPTCHA
    AUTHENTICATING --> IN_SESSION: S5 sign-in succeeds
    AUTHENTICATING --> HANDED_BACK: S6 one failed sign-in, or OTP not relayed
    IN_SESSION --> AWAITING_INSTRUCTION: S7 next step is irreversible
    AWAITING_INSTRUCTION --> IN_SESSION: S8 approver instructs against the object hash
    AWAITING_INSTRUCTION --> HANDED_BACK: S9 declined or timed out
    IN_SESSION --> EVIDENCE_PENDING: S10 closing step reached
    EVIDENCE_PENDING --> CLOSED: S11 evidence stored and reconciled
    IN_SESSION --> ABORTED: S12 scope breach, revocation, security event or drift
    IN_SESSION --> EXPIRED: S13 session time limit reached
    CLOSED --> [*]
    HANDED_BACK --> [*]
    ABORTED --> [*]
    EXPIRED --> [*]

    note right of CHECKED_OUT
      Mode C only. In Modes A and B the
      employer signs in and no credential
      ever reaches us.
    end note

    note right of AWAITING_INSTRUCTION
      Approve an EPFO return, generate a challan,
      mark an exit date, upload a Form 138
      statement, submit a PT return - each bound
      to the hash of what the portal shows.
    end note

    note left of ABORTED
      S12 and S13 apply from every active
      state, not only IN_SESSION - drawn once
      here for legibility. S14 links a retry
      or a Mode A filing to the prior session.
    end note

    note left of HANDED_BACK
      Artefact, form values, checklist and
      portal state go to the employer for
      Mode A before the hand-back cut-off.
    end note
